<mxCell id="ctx_inferred" value="&lt;b&gt;Inferred – verify&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Who scrapes /metrics is not defined in the repo.&lt;br&gt;• Zoom: no live call path to meeting creation was found.&lt;br&gt;• Groq, Africa's Talking (SMS) and Microsoft Teams/MSAL are installed or configured but never called from application code, so they are not drawn." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cc0000;fontColor=#cc0000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="440" width="360" height="150" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
